@startuml UC17_SelectStarter_Activity
title UC17 - Select Starter (Activity Diagram)
start
:New player completes registration;
:ScreenManager switches to StoryScreen;
:StoryScreen shows starter selection;

:Display 3 starter options;
note
  Loaded from story.json config:
  - Pokemon Name
  - Type
  - Base stats
end note

:Player selects starter;

:StoryScreen calls StoryService.GiveStarter(starterIndex);
:PokemonSpawner creates starter Pokemon;
:Starter added to Player.PokemonTeam;
:Player receives initial items (Pokeballs);

:Display "You received [Starter Name]!";
:Story mode begins;

stop
@enduml
